    },
    {
      "doc_id": "QS-CFW-4922-70",
      "query": "QS-CFW-4922-70 covers gear blank CFW-4922-70 (8620). Are the dimensional tolerances for keyway width and bore concentricity identical to QS-CFW-3173-95, or are there differences? If different, list the specific tolerances from this document."
