    {
      "doc_id": "SOP-P3-L2-03",
      "query": "In SOP-P3-L2-03 (First-article inspection - Ring Rolling line), what are the acceptance criteria for out-of-roundness and wall thickness variation for ring parts tied to QS-CFW-4922-70? Also, describe the disposition path if a first-article fails on concentricity."
