    },
    {
      "doc_id": "QS-CFW-1392-34",
      "query": "In QS-CFW-1392-34 for crankshaft blank CFW-1392-34 (4340), what are the runout and journal diameter tolerances listed, and which inspection gauges or CMM programs are specified for verifying those tolerances?"
