    },
    {
      "doc_id": "QS-CFW-5349-60",
      "query": "For track link CFW-5349-60 (15B37) in QS-CFW-5349-60: list the specified mechanical properties (yield, tensile, elongation) and the mandated heat treat recipe or reference. Also, what dimensional tolerances on pin bore spacing are enforced?"
