    },
    {
      "doc_id": "ECN-2026-010",
      "query": "ECN-2026-010 is a change notice for Hot Forge induction billet heater #3. What process or control changes were made (e.g., temperature uniformity, cycle time), and are there new monitoring or data logging requirements that affect process traceability for production batches?"
